{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_02",
  "title": "垂死的刺",
  "storyCode": "NL-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "113eca8ce31681bb4867d7070565b1d61b62a450706227b935c15c29ec6eaea5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 2-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "喝啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "你這感染者——竟敢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "退場吧，這裡不適合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_219",
      "text": "嘖！至少要把你拉出得分圈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "——！唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "還好，分數還在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "是嗎？礦石病垃圾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "唔！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "嘖，英格拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "好樣的！鏽銅！就這樣！把他逼出得分圈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "打爛他的手！就這樣！別讓這個感染者得手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "噓！小點聲！你看那邊的觀眾席......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動地觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "啊啊？那塊怎麼就坐著她一個人......“感染者騎士席位”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "小聲點，她往這邊看過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "哈，座位之間不是有隔離牆嗎？她什麼都聽不見吧？再說，難道感染者還敢翻過來打我不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "這才叫騎士劍術，英格拉，你那直來直往的動作真讓人看不下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "啐......感染者雜碎......也敢教訓我？等我把你剝皮拆骨......你會後悔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "（果然是個一點就著的莽夫......就這樣等著他失去理智......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "（唔，來了......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "該死的感染者垃圾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "——垃圾？我怎麼感覺，是你們這些不求上進的騎士，要更弱一點呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "咕，竟然能把我彈開......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "不，你那把短兵做不到這種事情......是源石技藝，風的法術？還是單純的推力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "我會告訴你嗎？奧爾默·英格拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "你——看我這一擊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "（突然——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "嘖，果然是風嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "看來只是能輔助移動的水準，比起風騎士那種精神病還是差了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "（試探......？他原來不只是個頭腦簡單的廢物嗎......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "哼，感染者......你那把劍並沒有安裝施術單元，你卻能施放法術......噁心，你體內骯髒的源石給你帶來的法術改變不了勝負......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "血騎士那傢伙也是，就因為冒出幾個稍微有點虛名的感染者騎士，他就要逼迫普通民眾承認感染者嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "監正會對你們也太好了點吧，要懂得感恩戴德，礦石病垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......感恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "對你們嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "......哈，你是什麼態度？在卡西米爾最底層匍匐掙扎的感染者，竟然反而看不起騎士貴族們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "感染者......你知道感染者為了一個合法身份要付出多少代價嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "哈，我為什麼要知道？我只知道你接下來會死得很慘——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "你知道剛產完卵就被捕捉的雌性鉗獸有多兇暴嗎？你知道，感染者騎士的選拔......是默許殺人的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "哦，“你會死得很慘”，大放厥詞啊，奧爾默·英格拉，你只是在享受欺壓弱小......你根本不敢傾力廝殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "——你見過被判定為廉價的生命是怎麼被處理的嗎？騎士貴族垃圾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "現在還牢牢站在得分圈裡的只有五個了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "*卡西米爾粗口*，我花了所有的錢押寶，結果那個廢物三十分鐘都沒進過得分圈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聒噪的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "怎麼還有個感染者？那個感染者在和“鏽銅”英格拉作戰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "喂！幹掉那些骯髒的傢伙！英格拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "英格拉！英格拉！英格拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？地震了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聒噪的觀眾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "不、不，是那邊那個感染者騎士......她剛才狠狠踹了一腳地面......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "這些傢伙......開始圍攻感染者了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "怎麼樣！？英格拉，嘗到苦頭了嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "唔......被包圍了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "......感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "你不該站在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "嗚——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "感染者，棄權吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "我不喜歡英格拉的做派，但無論是我的騎士團還是我的家族，都不會容忍感染者與我們同台競技的恥辱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "你這......淨說漂亮話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "別誤會了，最後能站在得分圈裡的本來就只有一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "這是一場亂戰，感染者，只不過現在，你似乎成為眾矢之的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "不知死活的小崽子......等我解決感染者之後，就是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "英格拉閣下......我已經負傷，難以爭奪冠軍，但至少現在，我們該聯手擊垮那個感染者奴隸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "這些下賤的感染者，竟敢對騎士大放厥詞。你們也是，都知道先前感染者引起的騷動吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "紅松騎士團本來就滿是嫌疑，傳言非法聚集感染者的幕後主使就是他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "利用和我們同台競技贏得來的財富，去禍害卡瓦萊利亞基乃至整個卡西米爾的安危？我們該縱容這種行為嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......非法感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "我看到的，只是一群無家可歸的可憐人，從工廠、農莊和鬥獸場被拋棄的可憐人！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "別嚷嚷，感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "你們要是真的這麼想，就該乖乖滾去感染者收容地區......而不是留在這裡，任人宰割。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "實話實說吧，你，巴不得殺光所有騎士，對吧？你滿腔憤怒，渴望復仇，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "那你還等什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "——你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "嘎啊——哈、哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "廢物！我會把你的手折下來，用它扇你耳光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "（不行，不能繼續纏鬥下去，得先——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "......此路不通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "你們......給我讓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "唔！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "該死......你們在做什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_218",
      "text": "我們只是站在這裡而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "這次你無路可逃了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
