    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "紅松騎士團——！你們想和這裡所有的騎士為敵嗎！？啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "——把他放下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "......這是為了其他騎士和全體觀眾的安全考慮，請您配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "鏽銅閣下，也請您快點離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_104",
      "text": "嘖，骯髒的騎士......我可不想因為礦石病毀了生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "......你也是感染者吧？冷靜一點，這裡可是特錦賽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "你們看不見他還有一口氣嗎！？滾開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "你們......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "冷靜點，你想要挑釁騎士協會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "正經的騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "text": "這裡應該交給醫療人員——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "咳！咳咳咳——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "哈........."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "讓我過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "別管她......她也是感染者，先安排觀眾退場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......嘿......不太好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "失血......已經是小事了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "感染的地方在作痛......它們在蔓延......好痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位尊敬的觀眾，因賽場突發事件，請隨工作人員安排，及時疏散，頒獎典禮將推遲至兩小時後舉行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "重複一遍——各位尊敬的觀眾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......野鬃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......求你......幫我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "......索娜會找到你的妻子和女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "......！源石在他的體表蔓延！不能再拖了，立刻裝進封閉箱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "text": "你們要做什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "text": "阻絕感染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "......你們......該死的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "艾沃娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "要記住他們每一個人的臉......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "記住......那些騎士......那些卡西米爾人......這些陰狠的兇手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "text": "別放過，他們任何一個......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "text": "輪到你了，快出牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "急什麼，讓我考慮考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "text": "你就剩幾張牌了你考慮什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "下面播報一則緊急新聞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "於今日進行的特錦賽花樣競技單元的奪旗戰項目，發生了一起意外——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "由於一位感染者騎士在比賽前瞞報身體情況，並在比賽中負傷後，堅持使用源石技藝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "——在比賽中途當場休克，經搶救無效死亡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "......感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "text": "......死亡？死了？死在賽場上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "據悉，相關醫療部門已經完成了賽場清理，競技場將於翌日消毒後重新投入使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "截止至事件發生後三個小時，國民院已經接到多條投訴，希望重改感染者騎士法案——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "......重改法案？裝模作樣，他們就是不敢打自己的臉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "text": "血騎士那個時候，他們迫於壓力承認了感染者的合法性，要是現在改回去，面子上哪掛得住？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "感染者問題可不是兒戲......“面子”還能影響決策？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "text": "幾十年前，騎士貴族們的“面子”，小過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "text": "時代不同了，雖然我不太懂他們在想什麼，但無論在任何地方，保護運作規則本身，比客觀的結果還優先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "text": "我們都吃過苦頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "text": "目前，現場已清理完畢，出於安全考慮，所有參賽騎士將在三日內接受醫療檢查——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對於此次事件，騎士協會同樣給予了高度關注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在，多個騎士團聯名向騎士協會建議，感染者的意外死亡，不可控的源石技藝，以及在特錦賽期間存在造成大規模感染的風險——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "喝——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "沒問題，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "武器的重心調整很完美，我已經很久沒有使用過如此得心應手的武器了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "啊......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "畢竟是根據姐姐先前的戰鬥特意調整的嘛，嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "......既然從資料上講已經初步調整好了，接下來，該稍微實戰一下試試手了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，靠邊站點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "啊......好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "兩位都不要勉強啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "......呵，不錯的眼神，瑪嘉烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "就該這麼認真，瑪嘉烈，你要是敢放水，我的自尊心可是會受傷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——對此，我們請到了多位騎士競技專家發表了自己的看法，請連線騎士協會負責人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，各位卡西米爾的市民，上午好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——感染者可以不依賴施術單元而施法，這在醫療領域已經有了淺顯的結論——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是放在賽場上，這是“極不公平”的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "（......公平。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "......公平嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "text": "想在規則中戰勝規則的主人？癡人說夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "呃......好、好啦，快鬆手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "抱歉，很久沒有用過長柄武器了，火候還不到家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "——瑪、莉、婭？你在笑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "欸，啊，對不起，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "......瑪嘉烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "你真的變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "唔？有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "......不是說外表啦，頭髮又亂了，過來，我幫你梳理一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，把梳子拿過來。在你的工作台後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "啊，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "......坐吧，休息一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "嗯，麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "真是......感覺離你上次離開，也就是一眨眼的功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "（一眨眼的功夫......你又離我們更遠了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——據悉，死亡的感染者似乎與非法感染者事件有所牽連，相關情況仍在調查中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "騎士協會承諾，絕不會因為一些小小的風波，導致特錦賽賽程受到影響——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "text": "姐姐......那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "text": "又是英格拉嗎......在賽場上殺死對手，這種事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "螢幕裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——現在，參與感染者騎士相關賽事的觀眾，紛紛要求騎士協會作出處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "螢幕裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "與此同時，本次事件的直接參與人，“鏽銅”奧爾默·英格拉等數位騎士也接受了採訪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "您在聽嗎？馬克維茨先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，朱維爾，你接著說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "是。其實是來自騎士協會的一份表單，裡面記錄了本次比賽所有大騎士的個人資料和注意事項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "聯合會也不希望和這些大明星們搞壞了關係，所以希望我們多加注意吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "（都是些老牌選手......唔，果然耀騎士也在其中嗎......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "這位“逐魘騎士”也沒有騎士團所屬？我本以為打入特錦賽還不屬於任何騎士團的特例只有耀騎士一人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "而且，“逐魘騎士”......一般來說大騎士的封號都是言簡意賅的單字封號吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "他還不是大騎士？那他有什麼特別之處嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "啊，這位啊......哈哈。這位可讓騎士協會頭疼了許久，雖然我不太明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "他本人對騎士封號一類的事情完全不在意，對於聯合會的安排也是置之不理，但是也不會刻意違抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "是個怪人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "怪人嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "是，不過他的實力毋庸置疑，而且不知為何，似乎有一些騎士家族對他的身份很好奇，已經來協會問過很多次啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "不過我們也不是很清楚他的底細，似乎是從靠近薩爾貢那裡的某個鄉下來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "馬克維茨先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "......我知道了，你先走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "啊......對了，朱維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "唔？您說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "text": "我還是你認識的那個馬克維茨......不用對我這麼拘謹，挺不習慣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "text": "啊......遵命，我是說，明白，馬克維茨......先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
